#* {{quote-web|en|date=14 May 2015|author=Presskit|title=Kena saman nparks help please|site=forum.hardwarezone.com.sg|url=http://forums.hardwarezone.com.sg/ratings-board-27/kena-saman-nparks-help-please-5051018.html/|passage=I did not know that a permit was needed to set a tent. So this nparks people came and check and issued me a '''saman''' of $300!}}
#* {{quote-web|en|date=7 August 2015|author=Dylan Tan|title=SG Quirky: The A-Z of SG50|site=Business Times (Singapore)|url=http://www.businesstimes.com.sg/lifestyle/arts-entertainment/sg-quirky-the-a-z-of-sg50/|passage=“When the parking warden comes around, they shout: “'''Saman'''! '''Saman'''!” and drivers rush to their cars.”}}
#* {{quote-web|en|date=10 September 2015|author=Nina Syahirah|title=STGCC Celebrates SG50 with Custom Munnies|site=safra.sg|url=http://www.safra.sg/en/Articles_Library/STGCC-Celebrates-SG50-with-Custom-Munnies.aspx#.VwDQ2RJ96Ho/|passage=When SG50 '''Saman''' Rider is on duty, no law breaker will get away!}}

